---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import FinalCta from '@/components/FinalCta.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About ELG" description="ELG is a Bangkok engineering company that starts with difficult real-world problems and builds reliable connected systems around them.">
  <section class="border-b border-brand-line bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-end gap-10 px-4 pb-16 pt-28 sm:px-6 sm:pb-20 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-600">About ELG</p>
        <h1 class="mt-5 text-balance text-5xl font-semibold leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.04em] text-brand-ink sm:text-7xl">Built around real operating problems.</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 lg:col-span-5">Curiosity finds the better question. Engineering discipline makes the answer work in the field.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-brand-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <h2 class="text-balance text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.03] tracking-[-0.035em] text-brand-ink sm:text-5xl">Technology starts with the problem.</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">We examine the objective, workflow, people, equipment, environment, data, and constraints before choosing the technology.</p>
        <blockquote class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-brand-orange pl-5 text-xl font-semibold leading-snug tracking-tight text-brand-ink">What could this system become if technology were designed around the problem from the beginning?</blockquote>
      </div>
      <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-brand-line bg-neutral-200 lg:col-span-7">
        <img src="/images/case-studies/pdf/isuzu-motorsport-telemetry-4.jpg" alt="ELG engineer working beside a deployed in-vehicle system" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover" />
        <figcaption class="border-t border-brand-line bg-white px-5 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">Engineering becomes valuable when it reaches the equipment and the people responsible for the outcome.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-brand-coal text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28">
      <h2 class="max-w-3xl text-balance text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.03] tracking-[-0.035em] sm:text-6xl">Challenge the architecture, not just the code.</h2>
      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white/15 md:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="bg-brand-coal p-7"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-orange">01</p><h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">See the whole system</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">Find the gap between operations, equipment, software, and people.</p></article>
        <article class="bg-brand-coal p-7"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-orange">02</p><h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">Build for reality</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">Treat field conditions, installation, support, and ownership as design inputs.</p></article>
        <article class="bg-brand-coal p-7"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-orange">03</p><h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">Learn into capability</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">Turn repeated field learning into reusable foundations for the next challenge.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-600">Company direction</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.03] tracking-[-0.035em] text-brand-ink sm:text-5xl">From problem to platform.</h2></div>
      <ol class="space-y-0 border-y border-brand-line lg:col-span-7">
        {['A problem creates a solution.', 'Repeated solutions build capability.', 'Capability becomes reusable infrastructure.', 'Infrastructure creates platform opportunity.'].map((item, index) => (
          <li class="flex gap-5 border-b border-brand-line py-5 last:border-b-0"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-brand-ember">0{index + 1}</span><p class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-ink">{item}</p></li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
  <FinalCta />
</BaseLayout>
